==================== Input ====================
/* `progid:` is a verbatim value, so its comments must be claimed from the
   positional cursor rather than printed again as declaration-tail comments. */
a {
  filter: progid:DXImageTransform.Microsoft.#{$f /* inner */}(opacity=20);
  filter: PROGID:DXImageTransform.Microsoft.Alpha(/* upper */ opacity=20);
}

